DERIVED ONTOLOGY DATA

The files cidoc7.1.json, cidoc6.2.1.json, crmsci3.2.json, crmdig5.0.json and
crminf1.2.1.json were produced by tools/convert_rdfs_to_json.py from the official
machine-readable encodings published by the CIDOC CRM Special Interest Group and
created by FORTH-ICS:

  CIDOC CRM 7.1.3  https://cidoc-crm.org/rdfs/7.1.3/CIDOC_CRM_v7.1.3.rdfs
  CIDOC CRM 6.2.1  https://cidoc-crm.org/versions-of-the-cidoc-crm
  CRMsci 3.2       https://cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crmsci/rdfs/3.2/CRMsci_v3.2.rdf
  CRMdig 5.0       https://cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crmdig/rdfs/5.0/CRMdig_v5.0.rdf
  CRMinf 1.2.1     https://cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/rdfs/1.2.1/CRMinf_v1.2.1.rdf

Each of those encodings states the licence CC BY 4.0 in its header
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

The JSON files are modified versions of that material. The modifications are:
RDF/XML converted to JSON; URIs of known CRM namespaces reduced to local names;
rdfs:comment flattened to plain strings; references into CRM-family models not
loaded by this application moved to a display-only "externalSuperclasses" list.
Class and property declarations and scope notes are reproduced from the source.

Attribution to the CIDOC CRM Special Interest Group and to FORTH-ICS is required
when these files, or the definitions and scope notes they contain, are reused.


